      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09523729525409501,
        "y0": 0.7319730568039858,
        "x1": 0.8932213355732886,
        "y1": 0.742640832449422
      },
      "text": "抵抗シリコンウェーハの研磨加⼯において、凹凸のない極めて平滑な研磨表⾯を形成する",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09523729525409501,
        "y0": 0.7492789906669166,
        "x1": 0.8932213355732886,
        "y1": 0.7599467663123526
      },
      "text": "ことができ、研磨速度が⼤きく、循環使⽤した場合でも研磨速度の低下が⼩さいと記載さ",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09523729525409501,
        "y0": 0.7665849245298472,
        "x1": 0.19498530029399422,
        "y1": 0.7772527001752833
      },
      "text": "れている。",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09523729525409501,
        "y0": 0.7838908583927777,
        "x1": 0.2548341033179337,
        "y1": 0.7945586340382139
      },
      "text": "【先⾏技術⽂献】",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09523729525409501,
        "y0": 0.8011967922557083,
        "x1": 0.21493490130197404,
        "y1": 0.8118645679011445
      },
      "text": "【特許⽂献】",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09523729525409501,
        "y0": 0.818502726118639,
        "x1": 0.21493490130197404,
        "y1": 0.8291705017640751
      },
      "text": "【０００４】",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09523729525409501,
        "y0": 0.8358086599815696,
        "x1": 0.5141789164216717,
        "y1": 0.8464764356270058
      },
      "text": "【特許⽂献１】特開２００１-３０３６号公報",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09523729525409501,
        "y0": 0.8531145938445002,
        "x1": 0.2348845023099539,
        "y1": 0.8637823694899364
      },
      "text": "【発明の概要】",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09523729525409501,
        "y0": 0.870420527707431,
        "x1": 0.39448131037379264,
        "y1": 0.881088303352867
      },
      "text": "【発明が解決しようとする課題】",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09523729525409501,
        "y0": 0.8877264615703615,
        "x1": 0.21493490130197404,
        "y1": 0.8983942372157976
      },
      "text": "【０００５】",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09523729525409501,
        "y0": 0.9050323954332921,
        "x1": 0.8932213355732886,
        "y1": 0.9157001710787283
      },
      "text": "⼀般に、ウェーハの研磨速度を向上させるために、研磨⽤組成物にアミン化合物を配合",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09523729525409501,
        "y0": 0.9223383292962228,
        "x1": 0.8932213355732886,
        "y1": 0.9330061049416588
      },
      "text": "することが⾏われている。しかしながら、アミン化合物の配合量が過剰になると、ウェー",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
